ららら... せんぶ　せんぶ　せんぶ
La la la... All of it, all of it, all of it.

444
00:31:57,248 --> 00:32:00,548
ドキドキ
Pit-a-pat...

445
00:32:45,348 --> 00:32:48,848
Mm, is there someone hiding over there?

446
00:32:48,948 --> 00:32:53,348
You don't have to be shy. Come on over, take a seat.

447
00:32:53,848 --> 00:32:59,848
You didn't think you could enter my forest without being invited for a cup of tea, did you?

448
00:33:00,048 --> 00:33:05,548
Come on, scoot closer. Have a sip. It won't hurt, I promise.

449
00:33:20,248 --> 00:33:23,748
Hey, you. You're finally awake.

450
00:33:24,048 --> 00:33:27,048
You were trying to enter the forest, right?

451
00:33:27,148 --> 00:33:29,848
Walked right into my tea party,

452
00:33:29,948 --> 00:33:33,248
same as all the other saplings in this forest.

453
00:33:33,348 --> 00:33:35,448
That was your first mistake.

454
00:33:35,548 --> 00:33:39,548
Us herbal tea tenders have a hard time leaving afterwards.

455
00:33:40,048 --> 00:33:45,348
Speaking of leaves... look at you. You've already sprouted yours.

456
00:33:45,748 --> 00:33:49,848
You're growing into a wonderful little sapling already.

457
00:33:49,948 --> 00:33:52,848
My tea is pretty potent, huh?

458
00:33:53,248 --> 00:33:57,248
Don't worry, little sapling. You'll come around to life with nature.

459
00:33:57,348 --> 00:34:00,648
You can leave all of your human worries behind.

460
00:34:00,748 --> 00:34:05,148
Civilization, society, work...

461
00:34:05,248 --> 00:34:08,048
None of that matters when you're a tree.

462
00:34:08,148 --> 00:34:10,948
I'll take good care of you here.

463
00:34:12,048 --> 00:34:15,048
And it looks like you do need some care.

464
00:34:15,248 --> 00:34:18,848
Your freshly sprouted leaves need some attention.

465
00:34:18,948 --> 00:34:22,048
Here, here. Let me get some tools.

466
00:34:23,548 --> 00:34:25,848
Hmm, what should I use on you?

467
00:34:26,048 --> 00:34:28,148
Let me check my box.

468
00:34:31,048 --> 00:34:33,548
Syringe? No.

469
00:34:36,548 --> 00:34:38,948
Wrench? Mm...

470
00:34:41,048 --> 00:34:43,548
Banana? Maybe.

471
00:34:44,248 --> 00:34:46,548
Scalpel? Mm...

472
00:34:49,048 --> 00:34:52,048
No, scissors would be better.

473
00:34:52,848 --> 00:34:55,548
Ah, I'll just grab whatever.

474
00:34:57,848 --> 00:35:00,048
Sorry to keep you waiting.

475
00:35:01,256 --> 00:35:03,056
What's that look for?

476
00:35:03,456 --> 00:35:05,156
Oh, worried about these?

477
00:35:07,456 --> 00:35:09,156
You know I wouldn't hurt you.

478
00:35:09,656 --> 00:35:12,756
I just need to prune some of your leaves.

479
00:35:14,356 --> 00:35:19,456
I would tell you to stay still, but... you don't have much of a choice like this.

480
00:35:20,656 --> 00:35:23,756
Yeah, yeah... this one?

481
00:35:26,956 --> 00:35:29,056
And this one?

482
00:35:38,856 --> 00:35:40,456
There! Doesn't that feel better?

483
00:35:40,856 --> 00:35:44,256
I'm sure all those extra leaves were weighing you down.

484
00:35:45,956 --> 00:35:49,656
Aww, what about... this one?

485
00:35:56,856 --> 00:36:01,356
Uh-oh, maybe... that one was important?

486
00:36:03,056 --> 00:36:08,056
Uh-oh, don't worry about that, little Sapling. It'll grow back!

487
00:36:09,356 --> 00:36:12,856
Uh, let's... move on here...

488
00:36:14,156 --> 00:36:18,956
I will use this brush to clean your leaves...

489
00:36:21,056 --> 00:36:24,456
...the remaining leaves, I guess.

490
00:36:27,556 --> 00:36:31,756
Yoshi, yoshi... Yoshi, yoshi...
There, there... There, there...

491
00:36:32,856 --> 00:36:34,256
There, there...

492
00:36:34,656 --> 00:36:36,856
I'll accept you, even if you lose all of your leaves.

493
00:36:37,056 --> 00:36:42,056
As Master Fauna, I'll provide you with the nutrients you're no longer able to create through photosynthesis.

494
00:36:42,356 --> 00:36:44,256
Yoshi, yoshi...
There, there...

495
00:36:49,856 --> 00:36:51,556
Looks good.

496
00:36:52,056 --> 00:36:54,856
Now, if you want to grow those leaves back...

497
00:36:55,356 --> 00:36:58,256
I think you'll need some water!

498
00:36:58,256 --> 00:37:01,356
Ah, but not too much, don't want those roots to rot away!

499
00:37:07,756 --> 00:37:12,556
There! With care like this, you'll want to stay in the forest forever, right?

500
00:37:13,956 --> 00:37:16,856
Now, let me just get you one more thing...

501
00:37:20,256 --> 00:37:23,656
Hey! Where are you looking? Don't even think about it!

502
00:37:35,056 --> 00:37:37,256
Here, here, have a bite of this!

503
00:37:37,556 --> 00:37:39,856
I'm sorry for hitting you with a book!

504
00:37:40,856 --> 00:37:43,756
Oh, there, there! There, there! You'll be okay!

505
00:37:44,156 --> 00:37:48,856
Come on, I need you on nice and normal vibes so you can watch the rest of my showcase, okay?

506
00:38:22,556 --> 00:38:27,556
神様の神様
[Title: God of Gods]

507
00:38:35,356 --> 00:38:41,056
一体この世はどうなって居るのかな
I wonder what in the world is happening to this world?

508
00:38:41,056 --> 00:38:48,056
私の空を飛び越えて 地球の周りをくるくると
Flying over my sky, spinning round and round the Earth...

509
00:38:48,056 --> 00:38:54,856
月火水木金土日に 繰り返すこのバイオリズム
Monday, Tuesday, Wednesday, Thursday, Friday, Saturday, Sunday, this repeating biorhythm...

510
00:38:54,856 --> 00:39:00,256
全人類の選択肢 みたいなテスト
A test like options for all mankind...

511
00:39:00,256 --> 00:39:06,156
So I'm just spinning around, around, around the world

512
00:39:06,156 --> 00:39:12,756
好き 嫌いがない ない ないから
Because there is no "like" or "dislike", none at all...

513
00:39:12,756 --> 00:39:18,956
Spinning around, around, around the world

514
00:39:18,956 --> 00:39:26,056
大気にもどかしい 思い 伝えたいから
Because I want to convey my frustrating feelings to the atmosphere...

515
00:39:26,056 --> 00:39:30,156
最近どんなのって言われや
When asked "How have you been lately?"

516
00:39:30,156 --> 00:39:33,256
"I'm fine, thank you" だっていえるでしょ
I can say "I'm fine, thank you", right?

517
00:39:33,256 --> 00:39:37,056
ぐんぐん手頃になる私を
