526
00:40:24,464 --> 00:40:29,864
I'm just spinning around, around, around, around the world

527
00:40:29,864 --> 00:40:32,464
好きにしてもいい？
Can I do whatever I want?

528
00:40:32,464 --> 00:40:37,064
いい？ いい？ いいかな？
Is it okay? Is it okay? Is it really okay?

529
00:40:37,064 --> 00:40:43,064
欲しいもの叶い... 叶い... 叶わないなら
If my wishes can't come... can't come... true,

530
