00:51:39,080 --> 00:51:42,180
But I was happy to sing them,

645
00:51:42,280 --> 00:51:47,480
and I was especially happy to be able to perform with Watame and Gura as well!

646
00:51:48,080 --> 00:51:51,280
So thank you two for performing with me!

647
00:51:51,380 --> 00:51:58,780
And thank you, you guys, because it's because of you that I'm able to stand here like a true idol!

648
00:51:58,880 --> 00:52:04,680
And look, I changed! I changed from before! I'm wearing my idol outfit now!

649
00:52:07,880 --> 00:52:11,880
It's really pretty! I especially love when it glows like this.

650
00:52:12,080 --> 00:52:17,080
I think it matches the nighttime ambience perfectly.

651
00:52:17,180 --> 00:52:20,480
And I really feel like a magical princess!

652
00:52:20,580 --> 00:52:22,580
Because... because look! Come here, come here!

653
00:52:22,880 --> 00:52:27,480
Let me bless you with my sparkles!

654
00:52:27,880 --> 00:52:31,280
Doesn't it feel magical? I really love it!

655
00:52:33,180 --> 00:52:38,880
And I really love the nighttime version of the stage. It has completely transformed!

656
00:52:39,080 --> 00:52:43,780
I might be a little biased, I think I like the nighttime version better.

657
00:52:44,080 --> 00:52:47,880
It has these glowing orbs in the forest.

658
00:52:48,080 --> 00:52:51,080
I really wanted it to have a magical feel.

659
00:52:51,180 --> 00:52:56,580
And it has beautiful glowing flowers... there might even be some glowing mushrooms!

660
00:52:56,880 --> 00:52:59,880
You think they're poisonous? Will you check for me?

661
00:52:59,980 --> 00:53:02,180
No no, don't do that! It's too dangerous.

662
00:53:02,880 --> 00:53:05,980
Plus, I don't like eating mushrooms. Do you like them?

663
00:53:06,380 --> 00:53:10,580
Have Saplings learned to take all of my habits for their own yet?

664
00:53:12,380 --> 00:53:18,080
But I think on this stage, we also have... perhaps you've seen...

665
00:53:18,180 --> 00:53:22,580
Dancing Saplings! Look at you, aren't you cute?

666
00:53:23,080 --> 00:53:27,280
And they each have their own personalities. You all do.

667
00:53:28,080 --> 00:53:31,580
Which one is you? Is that you? That you?

668
00:53:33,880 --> 00:53:42,080
And the stage has also transformed the gazebo! Now instead of a tea party, we have this bed,

669
00:53:42,180 --> 00:53:46,080
which perhaps I will collapse on after this is done.

670
00:53:46,180 --> 00:53:48,380
Ugh, so sleepy!

671
00:53:50,180 --> 00:53:54,680
I need to hang in there a little more! Send me your energy!

672
00:53:55,080 --> 00:53:59,880
But actually, wouldn't I... wouldn't I go sleep in my beautiful cottage in the background?

673
00:54:02,880 --> 00:54:08,080
Maybe... maybe this is where the Saplings sleep! Saplings have to sleep outside.

674
00:54:08,180 --> 00:54:13,580
At least I gave you a nice... nice bed to sleep on in a nice gazebo!

675
00:54:15,080 --> 00:54:23,080
What do you think? Do you like the daytime version or the nighttime version? I'm a fan of the nighttime version myself.

676
00:54:24,880 --> 00:54:33,280
Well, I do have one more thing to show you in this stream. Can you guess what it is?

677
00:54:33,380 --> 00:54:36,680
It would be... dun dun dun dun dun!

678
00:54:37,080 --> 00:54:39,280
Wah, it's merch!

679
00:50:43,880 --> 00:54:44,280
I have more merch for you!

680
00:54:44,380 --> 00:54:48,880
I wanted to make something that would be really useful.

681
00:54:49,080 --> 00:54:54,880
And earlier this year, when I came to Japan for the first time, I discovered phone rings.

682
00:54:55,280 --> 00:55:00,080
They're a magical invention! They changed my life.

683
00:55:00,088 --> 00:55:01,888
It's starting to sound like an infomercial here.

684
00:55:02,188 --> 00:55:04,188
No, you cannot skip the ad!

685
00:55:04,188 --> 00:55:06,088
No skip ad!

686
00:55:08,088 --> 00:55:12,388
Um, if you're not familiar with the concept of a phone ring, basically...

687
00:55:12,388 --> 00:55:16,888
...you stick it on the back of your phone, any phone,

688
00:55:16,888 --> 00:55:20,088
and then you can use it to prop up your phone anywhere you go,

689
00:55:20,088 --> 00:55:23,588
and watch YouTube, watch me on YouTube, maybe.

690
00:55:24,088 --> 00:55:26,588
Or whatever else you want.

691
00:55:26,588 --> 00:55:29,088
Um, it's super useful to have a little stand,

692
00:55:29,088 --> 00:55:31,588
and it also can help you hold your phone, too.

693
00:55:31,588 --> 00:55:34,288
You can stick your fingers and it makes it more comfortable.

694
00:55:34,288 --> 00:55:37,788
You don't want to strain your pinky, do you?

695
00:55:39,288 --> 00:55:43,088
So that is the merch that I have created for you.

696
00:55:43,088 --> 00:55:46,588
I hope you'll find it useful. It is in the shape of a cute golden apple...

697
00:55:46,588 --> 00:55:48,888
...with a cute Sapling. There's kind of a Sapling theme.

698
00:55:48,888 --> 00:55:53,088
It makes sense, because all of this is possible because of you guys.

699
00:55:53,088 --> 00:55:55,088
Thank- Thank you.

700
00:55:55,088 --> 00:55:57,288
Cute Saplings around, cute Sap...

701
00:55:57,288 --> 00:56:00,088
...Sap Ring, phone ring...

702
00:56:00,688 --> 00:56:04,888
I hope you'll like it. I hope you'll find it as useful as I have found it.

703
00:56:04,888 --> 00:56:08,588
I hope it'll be useful merch for you.

704
00:56:09,688 --> 00:56:13,688
And, so with that, I'm afraid...

705
00:56:13,688 --> 00:56:16,388
...that our time is just about up.

706
00:56:16,388 --> 00:56:19,488
But again, I really wanted to thank you.

707
00:56:19,488 --> 00:56:22,088
You for being here, and watching, and cheering me on.

708
00:56:22,088 --> 00:56:26,088
I'm just- I'm just a gaming Kirin.

709
00:56:26,088 --> 00:56:30,088
But because of you, I can also be an idol!

710
00:56:30,088 --> 00:56:34,088
And it has been a really magical experience...

711
00:56:34,088 --> 00:56:37,588
...here in my forest. I'm glad you can finally see.

712
00:56:37,588 --> 00:56:41,088
Finally see where I've been streaming all this time.

713
00:56:41,088 --> 00:56:45,088
Closet- Closet is... is over there.

714
00:56:45,088 --> 00:56:49,088
That's where- That's where I'm streaming for you.

715
00:56:49,588 --> 00:56:52,088
Finally revealed.

716
00:56:52,088 --> 00:56:54,088
Thank you... thank you,

717
00:56:54,088 --> 00:56:58,588
from the bottom of my heart, for coming today! I appreciate it!

718
00:56:58,588 --> 00:57:03,588
Because of you, I can be here and be an idol and... a gamer!

719
00:57:03,588 --> 00:57:08,088
And live out my dreams! Thank you! Thank you!

720
00:57:08,088 --> 00:57:13,088
And please don't forget to watch the other Council members' 3D showcases!

721
00:57:13,088 --> 00:57:18,088
And watch IRyS's too, even if it was a while ago!

722
00:57:18,088 --> 00:57:22,588
And I... want to...

723
00:57:22,588 --> 00:57:26,288
Thank you, thank you, thank you! I can't say it enough!

724
00:57:26,288 --> 00:57:28,088
Thank you, thank you, thank you, thank you...

725
00:57:28,088 --> 00:57:30,888
...for watching! And...

726
00:57:30,888 --> 00:57:33,888
...I will see you very soon. I appreciate you.

727
00:57:33,888 --> 00:57:36,088
Thank you for being here. I hope you had a good time,

728
00:57:36,088 --> 00:57:38,288
and I will see you next time!

729
00:57:38,288 --> 00:57:40,888
Faunwell! Bye-bye!

730
00:57:40,888 --> 00:57:44,588
Bye!

